      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my opinion, Nintendo wouldn't allow the game on its console because of the 18+ features. I'm pretty sure Nintendo goes for family-friendly games anyway. The game would run horrendously if it weren't put on the Switch 2, though I never had hands-on experience with the newer console. The hardware in the original switch is years old, and it lags when playing on Minecraft. I would be surprised if it would even launch any decent VRChat world on the weak hardware. Rec Room takes forever to load worlds on the Switch. I highly doubt the switch would be able to handle VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
