  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-03-04T18:27:50.618Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello,\n\nI am part of a community of players, and many of us have been discussing the possibility of bringing the game to Nintendo Switch. A lot of players do not have access to a powerful PC or a VR headset, and even on mobile devices, we often don’t have the required performance to run the game properly.\n\nBecause of this, a Nintendo Switch version — even if it had certain limitations compared to the PC version — could allow many more players to join the experience, connect with others, and become part of the community.\n\nWe understand that this would represent technical challenges, but we truly believe it could open the door to a wider audience and help the community continue to grow.",
